<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts $1.00 higher. Top</p>
<p>$60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    60.25-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-290 lbs    58.25-59.75</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    50.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    51.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    52.00-54.00</p>
<p>Hogs:  800	 Sltr - 800     Fdrs - None</p>
</text>
